  "2026-09-11T06:25:44.961Z","harness:codex","TDD and integration evidence: the initial new completeness and policy-id regressions both failed before implementation. All 53 focused tests now pass, including real CLI and MCP policy-id normalization, an assurance floor that fails with no policy, passes with an applicable policy and fails after deletion, and installed governance-audit append flags preserving assignment while edits/deletes refuse. Complete-population duplicate check and the delivered historical foundations are recorded. Full repository coverage, static gates, temporary manual acceptance and hosted review remain required."
  "2026-09-11T06:58:23.256Z","harness:codex","Verification progress: final typecheck, SDK snapshot check, generated CLI contract check, repository static quality and docs/skills checks passed. Linked regression suite passed 53 tests. Direct manual temporary CLI acceptance passed operand-only policy creation plus fail/pass evidence validation. Bare-core package-boundary rules and complexity limits remain unchanged."
  "2026-09-11T06:58:57.659Z","harness:codex","Local implementation verification complete: 8706 tests across 667 files passed; exact coverage 64172/64172 statements, 48869/48869 branches, 13337/13337 functions and 61480/61480 lines. Static quality, typecheck, generated contracts, SDK snapshot, package boundary, docs and exact 100 percent source/export/member docstrings passed. Manual temporary acceptance and linked tests passed. Hosted PR review, analyzer checks and merge remain delivery gates; this closure records implemented behavior, not publication."
  "2026-09-11T07:57:47.712Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery evidence on PR 1234 head a0227fc83: all hosted checks passed and exact-head DeepScan/CodeFactor reported zero issues. Full local release preflight passed, including 8706 tests across 667 files, exact 100/100/100/100 with zero uncovered counts, static quality and docstrings, 88 package-first dogfood commands, packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers, compatibility, and Sentry/telemetry gates. Platform matrix passed Linux Node 22/24/25, macOS and Windows on the identical runtime source. CodeRabbit completed the prior implementation review without actionable code findings; final CI-only follow-up review is awaiting its included-quota reset. Sourcery and Greptile are quota-limited, not approved. This evidence is pre-merge; publication remains independent."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-11T06:51:41.165Z","harness:codex","Public authoring compatibility: normalize the single authored id before entering the audited registry transaction; preserve invalid definition rejection, immutable mismatch refusal, no-op idempotence, dry-run semantics, and the callers object. CLI/MCP schema now requires definition only. The 4.19 schema constant intentionally changes its literal type; the SDK snapshot records the additive contract evolution."
